      "chunk_type": "table",
      "text_content": "| CWEs Mapped | Max Incidence Rate | Avg Incidence Rate | Avg Weighted Exploit | Avg Weighted Impact | Max Coverage | Avg Coverage | Total Occurrences | Total CVEs |\n|:-------------:|:--------------------:|:--------------------:|:--------------:|:--------------:|:----------------------:|:---------------------:|:-------------------:|:------------:|\n| 34 | 55.97% | 3.81% | 6.92 | 5.93 | 94.55% | 47.72% | 318,487 | 19,013 |",
